    {
      "author": "Matt B.",
      "meta": "3 weeks ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "body": "I appreciated that they were reasonably priced, fully insured, and respectful of my property and my time. They did an excellent job safely removing a tree that was getting too close to our house. We will be calling them for tree trimming any time we need it. They came for a free quote on my schedule and showed up to remove my tree when they said they would. They had the tree removed before I even heard back from another company. Very impressed!"
    },
    {
      "author": "Gabe O.",
      "meta": "3 weeks ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "body": "Felix and his team were prompt, quick and very professional. I was very happy with how they worked with our aging parents."
    }
  ],
